# SIH26251 Architecture

## Phase 1

Next.js frontend → FastAPI backend → AI/ML services → synthetic JSON data.

External services:
- OpenStreetMap / Leaflet
- OSRM
- Open-Meteo

## Phase 2

Supabase can be added later for:
- authentication
- persistent database
- real-time inventory
- IoT storage
- multi-user access

The initial code intentionally avoids Supabase.
